  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Weapon (War Fan), Grade 2</em></p><p>A ceremonial paper fan that appears ancient, but well maintained. It has been imbued with potent curses and can be properly used as a weapon. This paper fan can be used as a +1 War Fan with the addition of the finesse property and on a hit, it deals 1d8 slashing damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Retribution.</strong> As a reaction to taking damage, you can spend 2 CE to make a melee or ranged spell attack against the creature that damaged you if they are within 30 feet and on a hit you deal 4d8 slashing damage and the target's movement speed is reduced to 0 until the end of its next turn.</p>"
  },
